 "concept": "A white research station on a stepped platform. Landmark: a tall octagonal core tower (about 5 floors plus antenna spire) rising from the centre of an L-shaped ring lab that wraps its south and west sides. Roof lines step down from the tower to the wide 2-storey ring lab, then to a low glass lab annex and a machine hall. The orange stripe runs on the accent floor of every volume, with orange concrete on accent and glow bands for the lit windows. White concrete on pillar and wall2, light grey trim and a quartz base keep the palette to white, grey and orange. A landing pad sits on the flat roof of the wide hall. Interiors are large: halls 9-10 high and 15+ wide, labs 7 high. All detail goes outward: antenna, blade sign, porch and a bridge across the yard to the glass lab.",
